# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ORBIS environment configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in values as needed.
# All variables are OPTIONAL. ORBIS runs locally without any of them.
# NEVER commit real credentials.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- AI summarization (optional) -------------------------------------------
# ORBIS works without AI. When no provider is configured it produces
# deterministic basic summaries and labels them as such in the UI.
#
# Any OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint works (OpenAI, OpenRouter,
# Groq, a local Ollama/LM Studio server, etc.)
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# AI_API_KEY=sk-...                      # server-side only; never exposed to the browser
# AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# --- Ingestion -------------------------------------------------------------
# Token required to call POST /api/ingest (manual / scheduled ingestion trigger).
# If unset, the endpoint is disabled. Lazy background refresh of data still works.
# INGEST_TOKEN=change-me-to-a-long-random-string

# --- Data source toggles (optional) ----------------------------------------
# Individual sources can be disabled with ORBIS_SOURCE_<ID>_DISABLED=1
# (see src/lib/sources/registry.ts for source IDs).

# --- Map tiles (optional) --------------------------------------------------
# Default tile layer is OpenStreetMap. Provide a key-backed provider if you
# have one (e.g. a free Carto key). Tile attribution is shown on the map.
# ORBIS_TILE_URL=https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# ORBIS_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=© OpenStreetMap contributors

# --- Local port (optional) -------------------------------------------------
# Dev server port is chosen with `next dev -p <port>`; 3000 is used by default.
# If 3000 is occupied use e.g. `npm run dev -- -p 3001`.
